jarat, Haryana, Jharkhand, Karnataka, Madhya Pradesh, Maharashtra, Odisha, Punjab, Rajasthan, Tamil Nadu, Telangana, Tripura, Uttar Pradesh and West Bengal for kind information. 2. The CMD/MD of NSC, HlL, NAFED, KRIBHCO, BBSSL for kind informalion and necessary action. 3. The Director, All Crop Development Direclorates, DA&FW- for kind information and necessary action. 4. The Under Secretary (Pulses Mission/CA-V), DA&FW, Krishi Bhawan, New Delhi, 5. The Lead Programmer (Pulses Mission/NFSNM), DA&FW with a request to upload on the NFSNM website. Copy also to: l. The Senior PPS to Secretary (A&FW), Krishi Bhawan, New Delhi. 2. The PPS to Additional Secrelary (Crops), DA&FW, Krishi Bhawan, New Delhi, 3. The PPS to Joint Secretary (Pulses Mission), DA&FW, Krishi Bhawan, New Delhi 4. The PPS to Jornt Secretary (Crops/NFSNM), DA&FW, Krishi Bhawan, New Delhi. 5. The PS to Director (Pulses Mission), DA&FW, Krishi Bhawan, New Delhi.",403,en,2025.0
