unds of rigorous per Master Trainer hands-on training programs. - TA shall be as per actuals - Krishi Sakhis (CRP) trained at NF model demonstration farms of FMT/ KVK/ AUs/ LNFI (Funds routed through MANAGE) (D) Training programs for farmers - No. of training institutes = 425 KVKs + 40 AUs + 200 LNFI = 665 - No. of farmers to be trained till March 2026 = 18.75 Lakh farmers - Total outreach of farmers under NMNF = 18.75 Lakh x 6 = 1.12 crore farmers (i) 18.75 Lakh farmers will have 2 rounds - 2 training programs (of 1 day 4,687.5 of 1 day each training at 665 KVK/ AU/ duration) per farmer in batches LNFI.",445,en,
