ides for Yellow Rust of Wheat Waiting Crop Common name Dosage per ha period from last of the disease application a.i (c) Formulation Dilution to (g/ml)% water harvest (in days) (L) Propiconazole 2570 EC Wheat Stripe rust or 125 gm 500gm 750 30 yellow rust Azoxystrobin 119lo + Tebuconazole 18.3% \v/w SC Wheat Stripe rust or 82.5+137.25 750 500 yellow rust Picoxfstrobin 7.059/o + Propiconazole 11.79lo SC Wheat Stripe rust or 200 1000 500 yellow rust Pyraclostrobin 133 g/l + Epoxiconazole 50g/l SE Stipe rust Wheat or t3'1.25 750 500 yellow rust Tebuconazole 507o + Trifloxystrobin 25oZ WG Wheat Stripe rust or 150+75 300 300- 40 yellow rust 500",377,en,2022.0
