aphids is the only way r t o decrease the crop loss. The Important IpM practices for management ofaphids are listed below: Regular surveitance on host crops including artemate hosts such as brinjal, cucurbits, cucumbers, long melon, pumpkin, tomato, chilli, oka should be carried out for trmely management of aphids.",508,en,2022.0
Advisory on management of Cucumber Mosaic Virus in Banana.pdf_001,ppqs_advisories,Advisory on management of Cucumber Mosaic Virus in Banana.pdf,1,"The Important IpM practices for management ofaphids are listed below: Regular surveitance on host crops including artemate hosts such as brinjal, cucurbits, cucumbers, long melon, pumpkin, tomato, chilli, oka should be carried out for trmely management of aphids. o o Grow flowering plants on the internal bunds inside the field Famers may use disease free and hearthy pranting material and assured from the concemed o planting material supplier that all the planting material are cMV disease fiee. o Farmers may follow crop rotation to avoid the occurrence / incidence ofCMV. Farmers rnay folrow the planting timings as recommended by SAU to escape the incidence of disease. o t F h a e rm b e a rs n a m na u s f t i e b l e d s e d p u a ca ra te s d it o t i o d e id s/ e p n re ti d $ a ', to c r o s n s r e ik rv e e S a p n i d d e a r u s g l m L e a n d t y th B e i n rd at u b r e al e t e le ne , m g i r e e s e a n v r a a i c la e b w l r e n g in , o predatory mites, Bra con hebetor, Trichogramma sp. and Hover fly. Set up yelrow water pan/sticky traps for monitoring aphid @ 4-5 traps/acre at the height of mid canopy. o Grow Marigold, Sunflower, Mustard, cowpea to attract the predators viz., coccineuids such as scymnus, Chiromenes sexmacuratus, and lacewings such as chrysoperra zastrowi s,remi, e predatory mantids, ladybird beetles and parasitic wasps. o Remove infected plants from fields and destroy them by burning or digging deep inside soil. Pesticides must be used as per label claim approved Ly the Registration committee. Detailed information is available on Directorate's website in the link http:i/ppqs.gov.inldivisionsicib_ 2 rclmajor-uses-of-pesticides. A list of recommended pesticides for aphids in Banana is attached at annexure-I Further the following strategies should be adopted for spreading awaxeness a.mong farmers: o Mobilization of extension functionaries at glass route level for regular monitoring of pests status. o Awareness among farming community through newspapers, printing and electronic media, Kisan Gosthi, leaflet and pamphlets. o The concerned officials at the districv division/ block level may be advised to take the suitable plant protection measures immediately The detailed information on pests' incidence may also be sent to the directorate through email ppa@nic.in or appa.ipm-dppqs@gov.in urgently to apprise the same to DeparBnent of Agriculture & Farmers' Welfare. Yours faithfully Encl: as above f U'-- (Dr. J.P. Singh) Copy for information: 1. PPS to Joint Secretary@P), DA & FW, Krishi Bhawan, New Delhi- 110001 2. The Director of Agriculture of other Banana grorir'ing states with the request to keep close watch on pest build up & take appropriate measures as indicated above 3. PPS to PPA for information 4.",511,en,2022.0
