Advisory on Safe & Judicious utilization of Paclobutrazol Plant Growth Regulator.pdf_000,ppqs_advisories,Advisory on Safe & Judicious utilization of Paclobutrazol Plant Growth Regulator.pdf,0,"Phone:0129-2413985 E-najlrppa@rc in F.No 3_6/2022_23,Ipltr/Advisorv $[TRRfcFMov€rnment of India CTq-{4, $+ErqR({RcrsrD _ 121 001/ NHJV, Faridabad (Haryana) _ 121 001 Dated,: 03.71.2022 To, The Director Agdculture Govemment of Gujarat Sector - 10, High Road, Krishi Bhavan, Gandhinagar cujarat- 382010 Sub: Advisory on Safe & Judicious utilization of .paclobutrazol, plant Growth Regulator -reg. Sir, It has come to the notice of this Directorate that ,paclobutrazol, plart Growth regulator (PGR) is being used irdiscriminately in various crops including vegetables and cereals by the farmers of Gujarat state & considering huge profit margln, agri_input dealers may find it lucrative for selling this pGR product therefore dealers might be suggesting use ofthis pGR to the farmers. It is pertinent to mention that acute toxicity data indicates paclobutlazol (ptsZ) is moderately acute toxic by oral and inhalation routes, while it is low acute by dermal route of application. The product is slight ir tatiDg to skir &eyes and very roxlc ro aquatic life thus the producvformulation containing molecule may be avoided oear aquaculture and it is having high nobility, high stability and potertial for bioaccumulation, i[volving risk to soil & ecosystem. 'Paclobutrazol' 23Vo w/w SC is a plant GroMh Regulator (pGR) is mainly used for reducing the vegetative gro]vth and induces flouTering & enhancing the yield in several horticultural crops. It is recommended for groMh regulation in Mango, Pomegranate, Apple, Cotton and Groundnut crops as per details given at Annexure_l (Copy enclosed). Which is available at Dppe&S website at link Contd .,,.......... Page No. 2 Further, it is known that indiscriminate and injudicious use of Agro chemicals including Paclobutiazol in agriculture may results in several associated adverse ell.ects such as envl pesticid ces' human ard animal heal hazards, destruct fodder, soil and water, pest srrgence, _., bio-conhol agents etc. It is therefore, requested to issue necess diection to field frnctionaries for sensitizing farmers and agri-input dealers to prudently use paclobutrazol plant Growth Regulator at recommended doses on app ed crops only and to stop its use on crops on which it is not approved by th6 Registrat Committee (RC). Yo faithtully Encl: as above /.1 (Dr. t Pr Plant ction Adviser info Copy for arion: l. Joint 2, D PP ir S e c to to @p A & FW, Kishi Bhawan, New De-l'h^i._' l""t'0""0'0t shi Bhawan, New Deffri_ i fdoof 3. PPS to PPA with the state authorities a(ld sensitize Usaee of Pa ctob u trazol 23y. SC (Ww) in crops S.No Ag€ of Tr€e/Crop Dosage/Tree Dilution in water Waiting of the ingredient Period Tree /Crop Iast sPray lo Mango 345 l5ml/hee Recommended quantity diluted in l6-25 Years 4.6 20mlltree clean water of 5 litres >25 Years 5.15-9.2 25-40m1/lr€e and applied in tuIrow 5 to l0 cm deep about 30 cm away ilorn the trunk Fill up with soil (To reduce the hter after application or node length ofnew apply as soil - collar shoots and earlier formation of drench. telmilral bud. Favourably, innu€nce the fruit bud production, fruit colour ard hary€st yield) 2.",499,en,2022.0
