 cfiiceps oN ,ehcadaeH ylekilnU – 5 elbaT neerG cixot ylthgilS lytubpofolahyC .91 yllaitnesse si tnemtaerT ,aesuan ,noitatiplap etuca tneserp ot .citamotpmys dehsufl ,gnitimov lamron ni drazah fo noitatirri ,ecaf esu dna seye ,taorht ,eson -od- eulB cixot yletaredoM rolhcatuB .02 .cte niks ylekilnU – 5 elbaT neerG cixot ylthgilS rolhcaliterP .12 etuca tneserp ot lamron ni drazah esu -od- eulB cixot yletaredoM lyhtemarumyrolhC .22 REHTO ,etoditna cfiiceps oN ,ehcadaeH yletaredoM II ssalC wolleY cixot ylhgiH linorpiF .32 yllaitnesse si tnemtaerT ,aesuan ,noitatiplap suodrazaH .citamotpmys dehsufl ,gnitimov -od- -od- -od- dirpolcadimI .42 fo noitatirri ,ecaf dna seye ,taorht ,eson .cte niks INTEGRATED PEST MANAGEMENT PACKAGE FOR RICE Plate-1: Symptoms of important diseases of rice Courtesy : NCIPM Courtesy : NCIPM Courtesy : CRRI Bakanae Bacterial leaf blight Brown spot Courtesy : CRRI Courtesy : CRRI Courtesy : CRRI Courtesy : CRRI Leaf Blast Nodal Blast Sheath Blight False smut on rice panicles 41 INTEGRATED PEST MANAGEMENT PACKAGE FOR RICE Plate 2: Important insect pests of rice Courtesy : NCIPM Courtesy : NCIPM Courtesy : NCIPM Courtesy : DRR YSB Moth White ear head due to YSB Leaf folder moth Folder leaf with larva Courtesy : DRR Courtesy : DRR Courtesy : DRR Courtesy : CRRI Courtesy : NCIPM BPH adult and nymph (upper) and hopper burn (lower) Gall midge adult (upper) and Thrips damage its",512,en,2014.0
