SHM_Guidelines472016.pdf_033,schemes,SHM_Guidelines472016.pdf,33,"76 76 2.1.2 Introduction of 25000 25000 25000 Annual action plan will be cropping system; prepared and suitable organic Organic seed cropping system based on soil procurement or testing will be introduced. Each raising organic farmer member will be assisted nursery @ for land preparation, plant Rs.500/acre/year x protection, labor charges and 50 acres other materials required for raising organic seeds / planting material in the farm field. 2.1.3 Traditional organic 75000 0 0 Each farmer member will be Input Production assisted for procurement of 77 units like ma terials required (glass, panchagavya, plastic bottles, drum, filters, Beejamruth and sprayers, other utensils etc) for Jeevamruth etc. construction and operation of @ Rs.1500 /unit / organic input production units. acre x 50 acre 2.1.4 Biological 50000 25000 25000 Each farmer member will be Nitrogen Harvest assisted for procurement of planting seeds, preparation of land /pits, (Gliricidia, labor etc for plantation of Sesbania, etc) @ nitrogen harvesting plants. Rs. 2000/acre x 50 acre 2.1.5 Botanical 50000 0 0 Each farmer member will be extracts assisted for procurement of production materials required (glass or units plastic bottles, drum, filters, (Neem cake, Neem Sprayers, other utensils etc) oil) @ for construction and Rs.1000/unit/ acre operation of botanical extract x 50 acre production units. Total 250000 100000 100000 450000 77 77 S.No Component Pattern of Assistance (in Rs) Remarks 2.2 Integrated Manure 1st year 2nd year 3 rd Management year 2.2.1 Liquid Biofertilizer 25000 0 0 Each farmer member consortia (Nitrogen will be assisted for fixing / Phosphate procuring liquid Solubilizing/ potassium biofertilizer and its mobilizing biofertilizer) application to soil/seed @ Rs. 500/acre x 50 to increase crop production. 2.2.2 Liquid Biopesticides 0 25000 0 Each farmer member (Trichoderma viridae, will be assisted for Pseudomonas procuring and fluorescens, application of liquid Metarhizium , biopesticides for Beaviourie bassiana, suppression of disease in Pacelomyces,verticilliu crop plants. m) @ Rs. 500 /acre x 50 2.2.3 Neem Cake/ Neem Oil 0 25000 0 Each farmer member @ Rs.500/acre x 50 will be assisted for procuring and application of Neem 77 Cake/ Neem Oil for control of pest and disease. 2.2.4 Phosphate Rich Organic 50000 0 0 Each farmer member Manure / Zyme will be assisted for Granules @ Rs. procuring and 1000/acre x 50 application of Phosphate Rich Organic Manure / Zyme Granules to soil to meet phosphorus / Zinc deficiency in soil. 2.2.5 Vermicompost (size 250000 0 0 Each farmer member 7’x3’x1’) @ Rs.5000/ will be assisted for unit x 50 procurement of earth worms, preparation of pits, construction of brick wall, labour charges and other raw materials required for construction of vermi composting units. Total 325000 50000 0 375000 78 78 2.3 1 2 Custom Hiring st nd 3rd Rema rks year year year Centre (CHC) Financial assistance will charges be given for procuring 2.3.1 Agricultural 15000 15000 15000 Financial assistance will be packing material, implements (As given for a cluster to manage preparation of labels, per SMAM their members to pay the Holograms, printing guidelines) charges of custom hiring centre etc., and branding of i.",509,en,2016.0
