nklers / foggers in the Add 25-50 ml of edible oil in concentrates per kg and fed animal shed to the animal during cold waves iv) Application of white reflector Apply / sprinkle lime powder (5-10g per square feet) in paint on the roof to reduce the animal shed during cold waves to neutralize thermal radiation effect ammonia accumulation Cold wave : Covering all the wire meshed Put on the foggers / sprinklers during heat weaves and walls / open area with gunny bags/ heaters during cold waves in case of high productive polyethylene sheets with a mechanism for animals lifting during the day time and closing In severe cases, vitamin ‘C’ (5-10ml per litre) and during night electrolytes (Electral powder @ 20g per litre) should be added in water during severe heat waves.",432,en,
